# Dynamic map missing-key read performance

Measures repeated reads of an absent key and the resulting null value. The
lookup result is assigned to a dynamic binding so the timed loop performs no
output or extra scalar work.

>>> checkpoint map-implementation-baseline d74f693 map implementation baseline
The baseline is the first committed native map implementation.

>>> source
let values = {
    "present": 1
}
let last = 0

for (iteration in 0..100000) {
    last = values["missing"]
}

print(last)
